  </header>

  <div class="how-we-work__items">
    <article>
      <h3>Start with a practical problem</h3>
      <p>
        Each guide begins with a practical business problem and a record,
        decision, or test the reader can produce.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>Show sources and limitations</h3>
      <p>
        Guides use primary or official sources where available and state
        limitations. Read the <a href="/editorial-standards/"
          >Editorial standards</a
        >.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>Document material corrections</h3>
      <p>
        Material corrections follow a documented <a href="/corrections/"
          >Corrections</a
        > process so substantive changes remain visible.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>Keep boundaries visible</h3>
      <p>
        Commercial status is recorded in the <a href="/advertising-disclosure/"
          >Advertising disclosure</a
        >. The <a href="/publisher/">Publisher</a> page explains the publication-name
        byline; readers can also use <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
